say|KUSAKAM|This armor... It looks ancient.
say|KUSAKAM|There are symbols on it that I don't understand.
say|KUSAKAM|It stands here, at the edge of the canyon, before the exit.
say|KUSAKAM|But something tells me it's important.
say|KUSAKAM|Maybe it belonged to my ancestors?
say|KUSAKAM|Time to take it. It has to be with me.
say|KUSAKAM|Time to set out.
exit|
